    <item>
      <title>万亿算力白烧了？OpenAI Scaling Law论文被曝致命bug，整个AI圈被“带偏”好几年！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/openai-scaling-lawbugai-20260706081009171-11/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 06 Jul 2026 08:10:09 +0800</pubDate>
